species-component: overview

Firrerreo are near-human sapients whose biology is defined by extraordinary resilience. They recover from serious injury at a rate that would be remarkable even by galactic standards, possess unusually broad visual and auditory ranges, and are deceptively strong and hardy for their humanlike build.

Traditional Firrerreo society places great weight on clan, personal self-reliance, and control of one's true name. Those are cultural tendencies rather than biological requirements; they appear below as Optional Disadvantages so a character may embrace them without being forced into a single personality.
